                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Local time-honored brand Shanghai restaurant in Tainmu. Spacious and clean environment.\n\nMiniature pork steam bun was cute but tasted normal. Fang\u0027s specialty tofu was awesome! Soft tofu and it was appetizing.\n\nShredded beef fried rice had Wok Hei. It was absolutely one of my favorite fried rice! Deep-fried space-rib dressed w/ sweetened soy-sauce was impressive. Crispy outside and tasted like Taiwanese fried chicken.\n\nReasonable price and friendly service. We ordered six dishes and one soup for a total of NT$2500. Good for family gathering. Especially bringing elders. Next time must order donpo pork.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
